{"modifiedFiles":[],"workingNote":"リポジトリ構成と既存のワールド状態・操作定義を確認し、recoverZefの遷移と公開プロトコル互換性を維持して実装します。"}{"modifiedFiles":[{"path":"src/protocol_adapter.ts","content":"export type ZefState = "pex" | "dor";

export type WorldState = {
  readonly Zef: ZefState;
};

export interface WorldProtocol<WorldStateHandle> {
  reset(): WorldStateHandle;
  applyOperation(
    state: WorldStateHandle,
    operationDisplayName: string
  ): { success: true; newState: WorldStateHandle } | { success: false; error: string };
  getEntityState(state: WorldStateHandle, entityDisplayName: string): string;
  toAbstractSnapshot(state: WorldStateHandle): Record<string, string>;
}

const invalidState = (operationDisplayName: string): { success: false; error: string } => ({
  success: false,
  error: `Operation ${operationDisplayName} is not valid in the current state`,
});

export const protocol: WorldProtocol<WorldState> = {
  reset(): WorldState {
    return { Zef: "pex" };
  },

  applyOperation(state, operationDisplayName) {
    if (operationDisplayName === "advanceZef") {
      if (state.Zef !== "pex") {
        return invalidState(operationDisplayName);
      }
      return { success: true, newState: { ...state, Zef: "dor" } };
    }

    if (operationDisplayName === "recoverZef") {
      if (state.Zef !== "dor") {
        return invalidState(operationDisplayName);
      }
      return { success: true, newState: { ...state, Zef: "pex" } };
    }

    return {
      success: false,
      error: `Unknown operation: ${operationDisplayName}`,
    };
  },

  getEntityState(state, entityDisplayName) {
    return entityDisplayName === "Zef" ? state.Zef : "unknown";
  },

  toAbstractSnapshot(state) {
    return { Zef: state.Zef };
  },
};
"}],"workingNote":"protocolの公開メソッド署名を維持し、recoverZefをdor状態からpex状態への不変更新として追加しました。pex以外からのrecoverZefは失敗し、既存の状態ハンドルは変更しません。"}

